  "title": "Expected length of a SIRSN spanning subnetwork",
  "statement": "For $k$ uniform random points $Z_1,\\ldots,Z_k$ in a square of area $k$, prove $\\mathbb{E}\\operatorname{len}[\\operatorname{span}(Z_1,\\ldots,Z_k)]\\sim\\ell k$.",
